{"unit_id":"tag:0A47:statement","translation":"代数闭（algebraically closed）基域（field）的扩张（extension）下的不变性（Invariance）<OWNARGEND_0001>设<MATH_0001>是特征（characteristic）为<MATH_0002>的代数闭（algebraically closed）域（field）。在第<REF_0001>节中，我们已经看到存在正合列（exact sequence）\n<MATH_0003>\n，其中第一个箭头（arrow）将<MATH_0004>映射（maps）到<MATH_0005>。余核（cokernel）的一组代表构成的集合（set）由多项式（polynomials）\n<MATH_0006>\n给出，其中<MATH_0007>。（如果<MATH_0008>不是代数闭（algebraically closed）的，还必须补入一些常数（constants）。）特别地，当<MATH_0009>是代数闭（algebraically closed）扩张（extension）时，映射（map）\n<MATH_0010>\n一般不是同构（isomorphism）。特别地，映射（map）\n<MATH_0011>\n，位于平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）基本（fundamental）群（groups）之间（此处插入将来的引用），也不是同构（isomorphism）。因此，仿射（affine）直线（line）的平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）同伦型（homotopy type）依赖于代数闭（algebraically closed）基域（field）。由上面的引理<REF_0002>可见，这种现象只在特征（characteristic）为<MATH_0012>且具有<MATH_0013>幂挠（-power torsion）系数（coefficients）时发生。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraically closed","target_term":"代数闭"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"Invariance","target_term":"不变性"},{"source_term":"characteristic","target_term":"特征"},{"source_term":"algebraically closed","target_term":"代数闭"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"exact sequence","target_term":"正合列"},{"source_term":"arrow","target_term":"箭头"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"cokernel","target_term":"余核"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"polynomials","target_term":"多项式"},{"source_term":"algebraically closed","target_term":"代数闭"},{"source_term":"constants","target_term":"常数"},{"source_term":"algebraically closed","target_term":"代数闭"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"fundamental","target_term":"基本"},{"source_term":"groups","target